79-0 jSxROl CardSection-styled__Card-sc-d8d454a7-1 fzxamW"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentViewport-sc-c83b7d79-1 darhMt"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentLarge-sc-c83b7d79-11 crcuKw"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 lcdruZ"><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 izcERK"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kXWhda">A Cozy Stroll Down Memory Lane</h2></div><div></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentMedium-sc-c83b7d79-10 evJNDy"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 lcdruZ"><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 izcERK"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kXWhda">A Cozy Stroll Down Memory Lane</h2></div><div></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentSmall-sc-c83b7d79-9 hLnvBp"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 lcdruZ"><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 izcERK"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kXWhda">A Cozy Stroll Down Memory Lane</h2></div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-label="cardSection_noLabel_contentCard2" data-cta-layout="ONE_ON_CARD" data-container-clickable="false" data-effective-hover-effect="NONE" class="Card-styled__Card-sc-c83b7d79-0 hIebLm CardSection-styled__Card-sc-d8d454a7-1 jVaMMn"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentViewport-sc-c83b7d79-1 dvxrKU"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentLarge-sc-c83b7d79-11 crcuKw"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2013</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">The Bee Has Landed</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 eARlXm"><br><br>Socks are the most requested item among the homeless population, <br>so we set out to make the comfiest pairs possible with a mission of <br><b class="RichText-styled__Bold-sc-ea745309-0 bXijnA">One Purchased = One Donated</b>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentMedium-sc-c83b7d79-10 evJNDy"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2013</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">The Bee Has Landed</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 eARlXm"><br><br>Socks are the most requested item among the homeless population, <br>so we set out to make the comfiest pairs possible with a mission of <br><b class="RichText-styled__Bold-sc-ea745309-0 bXijnA">One Purchased = One Donated</b>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentSmall-sc-c83b7d79-9 hLnvBp"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2013</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">The Bee Has Landed</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 eARlXm"><br><br>Socks are the most requested item among the homeless population, <br>so we set out to make the comfiest pairs possible with a mission of <br><b class="RichText-styled__Bold-sc-ea745309-0 bXijnA">One Purchased = One Donated</b>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-label="cardSection_noLabel_contentCard3" data-cta-layout="ONE_ON_CARD" data-container-clickable="false" data-effective-hover-effect="NONE" class="Card-styled__Card-sc-c83b7d79-0 dALqJc CardSection-styled__Card-sc-d8d454a7-1 dJSQTZ"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentViewport-sc-c83b7d79-1 dvxrKU"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentLarge-sc-c83b7d79-11 crcuKw"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2014</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">Hello, Sharks</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>Bombas appears on Shark Tank, winning an investment from Daymond John.  Orders explode overnight.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentMedium-sc-c83b7d79-10 evJNDy"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2014</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">Hello, Sharks</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>Bombas appears on Shark Tank, winning an investment from Daymond John.  Orders explode overnight.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentSmall-sc-c83b7d79-9 hLnvBp"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2014</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">Hello, Sharks</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>Bombas appears on Shark Tank, winning an investment from Daymond John.  Orders explode overnight.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-label="cardSection_noLabel_contentCard4" data-cta-layout="ONE_ON_CARD" data-container-clickable="false" data-effective-hover-effect="NONE" class="Card-styled__Card-sc-c83b7d79-0 fOTycJ CardSection-styled__Card-sc-d8d454a7-1 dJSQTZ"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentViewport-sc-c83b7d79-1 dvxrKU"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentLarge-sc-c83b7d79-11 crcuKw"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2016</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">A Million Reasons to Get Comfortable</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>After setting the goal of donating 1,000,000 donations within the first ten years, thanks to our customers, it takes less than three.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentMedium-sc-c83b7d79-10 evJNDy"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2016</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">A Million Reasons to Get Comfortable</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>After setting the goal of donating 1,000,000 donations within the first ten years, thanks to our customers, it takes less than three.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentSmall-sc-c83b7d79-9 hLnvBp"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2016</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">A Million Reasons to Get Comfortable</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>After setting the goal of donating 1,000,000 donations within the first ten years, thanks to our customers, it takes less than three.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-label="cardSection_noLabel_contentCard5" data-cta-layout="ONE_ON_CARD" data-container-clickable="false" data-effective-hover-effect="NONE" class="Card-styled__Card-sc-c83b7d79-0 cPlFf CardSection-styled__Card-sc-d8d454a7-1 jVaMMn"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentViewport-sc-c83b7d79-1 dvxrKU"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentLarge-sc-c83b7d79-11 crcuKw"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2019-2021</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">Everyday Upgrades</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>We reimagine everyday comfort in new underwear and tees (the #2 and #3 most requested clothing items among the homeless population), along with our first collection of super cozy slippers.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentMedium-sc-c83b7d79-10 evJNDy"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2019-2021</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">Everyday Upgrades</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>We reimagine everyday comfort in new underwear and tees (the #2 and #3 most requested clothing items among the homeless population), along with our first collection of super cozy slippers.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentSmall-sc-c83b7d79-9 hLnvBp"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2019-2021</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">Everyday Upgrades</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>We reimagine everyday comfort in new underwear and tees (the #2 and #3 most requested clothing items among the homeless population), along with our first collection of super cozy slippers.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-label="cardSection_noLabel_contentCard6" data-cta-layout="ONE_ON_CARD" data-container-clickable="false" data-effective-hover-effect="NONE" class="Card-styled__Card-sc-c83b7d79-0 hNJalz CardSection-styled__Card-sc-d8d454a7-1 dJSQTZ"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentViewport-sc-c83b7d79-1 dvxrKU"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentLarge-sc-c83b7d79-11 crcuKw"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2023</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">100 Million Donations        3,500 Giving Partners</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>With the help of our customers and our growing giving network, we hit over 100 million donations to those who need them most.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentMedium-sc-c83b7d79-10 evJNDy"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2023</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">100 Million Donations        3,500 Giving Partners</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>With the help of our customers and our growing giving network, we hit over 100 million donations to those who need them most.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentSmall-sc-c83b7d79-9 hLnvBp"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2023</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">100 Million Donations        3,500 Giving Partners</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>With the help of our customers and our growing giving network, we hit over 100 million donations to those who need them most.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-label="cardSection_noLabel_contentCard7" data-cta-layout="ONE_ON_CARD" data-container-clickable="false" data-effective-hover-effect="NONE" class="Card-styled__Card-sc-c83b7d79-0 ePcGri CardSection-styled__Card-sc-d8d454a7-1 dJSQTZ"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentViewport-sc-c83b7d79-1 dvxrKU"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentLarge-sc-c83b7d79-11 crcuKw"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2025</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">Game On</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>We launch sport-specific socks with <b class="RichText-styled__Bold-sc-ea745309-0 bXijnA">Bombas Sport </b>and open our first 3 stores so customers can feel Bombas in-person. </p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentMedium-sc-c83b7d79-10 evJNDy"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2025</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">Game On</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>We launch sport-specific socks with <b class="RichText-styled__Bold-sc-ea745309-0 bXijnA">Bombas Sport </b>and open our first 3 stores so customers can feel Bombas in-person. </p></div></div></div></div><div class="Card-styled__CardContentSmall-sc-c83b7d79-9 hLnvBp"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Header-sc-eede3638-6 kROBtm">2025</h2><div class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__SecondaryHeader-sc-eede3638-5 dnnEdY">Game On</div></div><div></div><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 bLkqCU"><p class="ContentSystem-shared-styles__Body-sc-eede3638-7 ipXwHC"><br><br>We launch sport-specific socks with <b class="RichText-styled__Bold-sc-ea745309-0 bXijnA">Bombas Sport </b>and open our first 3 stores so customers can feel Bombas in-person. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-label="cardSection_noLabel_contentCard8" data-cta-layout="ONE_ON_CARD" data-container-clickable="false" data-effective-hover-effect="NONE" class="Card-styled__Card-sc-c83b7d79-0 hAwrGf CardSection-styled__Card-sc-d8d454a7-1 dJSQTZ"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentViewport-sc-c83b7d79-1 dvxrKU"><div class="Card-styled__CardContentLarge-sc-c83b7d79-11 crcuKw"><div class="Content-styled__CardContentWrapper-sc-e8869373-1 eVeKuj"><div class="Content-styled__CardTextSetContainer-sc-e8869373-2 jIDnPS"><div class="TextSet-styled__TextSet-sc-6a87acf7-0 bWjGic Content-styled__CardTextSet-sc-e8869373-0 eDoYjk"><h2 class="ContentSystem-shared-styles_